00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:35.920
observe event and say observe every time the button is clicked, and then after we, you

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:40.680
know, once the button is clicked, we will then render a plot given the histogram of the

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:44.079
button click and save it to the output value.

